# Stack (this repository)

- Node ≥ 20, ES modules, zero runtime dependencies. Do not add packages to run the CLI or the site.
- Tests use `node:test` and `node:assert/strict`. Put them in `tests/`.
- The site is static: `site/index.html`, `site/styles.css`, `site/app.js`, `site/data.js`. No build step.
- Shell out only through `node:child_process` with explicit arguments; never interpolate user input into a shell string.
